    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know you have the protocols and the numbers, but you're just a machine. you don't get it. you don't feel the way my skin is burning or how empty everything feels. nothing is changing. we're just wandering through a graveyard. it feels like the world already ended, and i'm just a ghost that hasn't realized it yet.",
